Package: datablinder
Title: Blinded Copies of Sensitive Data Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Alex", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "baloo.142@gmail.com")
Description: Turns a sensitive data file into a blinded copy with the same
    columns, classes and file format but fake values, so that analysis code
    can be written against it and then run unchanged on the real data.
    Reduces disclosure risk; it offers no formal privacy guarantee.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
